\fB\-\-language <language>\fR
Language of localized table text; a missing translation shows another, labeled (\fB\-o json\fR prints all). Default: \fBen\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-headers\fR
Print table and csv without the header row.
.TP
\fB\-o, \-\-output <format>\fR
Output format: table, json, yaml or csv (csv: the table\(aqs rows; json and yaml: the whole response). Default: \fBtable\fR.
.SS "epx schemas references list"
List schema references.
.PP
.RS "4"
.nf
epx schemas references list [flags]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Reads schema references: schemas uploaded as a JSON schema file, for attribute types that schemas cannot define. TYPES lists the entity types a reference applies to; the file\(aqs URL is only in \fB\-o json\fR.
.PP
